{"ts":1793371809205,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 shipped in 4 PRs (mono #1-#4), all merged with CI and CD green. #1: validateApp throws when owner is missing, not a string, or blank; shared-contracts bumped 1.0.0 -> 2.0.0 (breaking). #2-#4: billing (payments), core-shell (platform), reports (insights) pass owner as literal strings. Assumptions: owner values are hardcoded to match each app's package.json team, since the build inlines the lib and nothing reads package.json at runtime; PRs merged in dependency order (#1 first). CD does not rebuild apps when libs/ changes, so there was no runtime breakage window beyond the gap between #1 and the app deploys. Live CDN not checked directly; verified via st deploy wait."}
